		{
			description: [
				"Breeding starts with bees you did not breed."
				""
				"Wild nests hold species you cannot make: crystalline, magmatic,"
				"glowing, ender, slimy, and the ordinary mining and carpenter bees."
				"Find them, cage them, and bring them home before anything else."
				""
				"Tick this off once you have a few species in hives."
			]
